# BUG: RT-04 Missing security headers

## Issue
HTTP responses lacked security headers: X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, X-Frame-Options, CSP frame-ancestors.

## Fix
- `vite.config.ts`: added `securityHeadersPlugin()` injecting X-Content-Type-Options nosniff, Referrer-Policy strict-origin-when-cross-origin, X-Frame-Options DENY, Content-Security-Policy frame-ancestors 'none' on all routes.
- `server/middleware/wallet-headers.ts`: already present, kept in sync.
- `out/redteam/RT-04-headers.md`: updated test expectation to X-Frame-Options: DENY present.

## Verification
Typecheck: `tsc --noEmit` passes. Build: `npm run build` passes. Headers verified via server middleware plugin on all routes.
