assessment.md
---
# BUG: RT-08 Large-input handling

## Issue
Large input (100k-char) in requests not properly handled - no 413/414 rejection, breaking harness expectations.

## Fix
- `vite.config.ts`: `server.maxHeaderSize: 131072` and `securityHeadersPlugin()` rejects URLs > 8000 chars with 414 URI Too Long before middleware runs.
- Dev server requires `NODE_OPTIONS=--max-http-header-size=131072` to allow 100k-char input to reach the 414 check; without the flag, Node default 8KB limit returns 431 earlier.

## Verification
Typecheck: `tsc --noEmit` passes. Build: `npm run build` passes.
